From 83dca67cb136e6fc11478003170d8d1eed27edff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:32:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: mediatek: hold MT6897 multimedia roots across
 transitions

Prepare selected MM_INFRA, display and VENC roots before genpd publication and retain them from before domain-on through acknowledged off. Validate the selected domain topology and providers, use checked phased VEN requests, and share fail-closed quarantine with the HWV ancestor. Preserve the MM_INFRA bootstrap owner until direct VEN admission completes, including early probe failure.

OVL physical-off retirement remains OVL-only. The existing VENC leaf/larb gate sequence is unchanged; this does not implement the complete vendor gate sequence or multimedia frequency ownership.

Add extracted-production-function coverage for register failures, shared references, topology admission, bootstrap handoff and cross-controller faults.

Link: https://github.com/MiCode/MTK_kernel_device_modules/blob/3c4ccd07d5624879555ec710c11bb8818e5cb5c6/drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-scpsys.c

Link: https://github.com/MiCode/MTK_kernel_device_modules/blob/3c4ccd07d5624879555ec710c11bb8818e5cb5c6/drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-scpsys-mt6897.c
